# 多阶段构建：node 编译（tsc -b && vite build）→ nginx:alpine 托管静态产物（研究笔记 §6 标准形态）
FROM node:20-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
RUN sed -i 's/dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/mirrors.aliyun.com/g' /etc/apk/repositories
COPY pnpm-workspace.yaml pnpm-lock.yaml package.json ./
COPY packages/shared/ packages/shared/
COPY packages/frontend/ packages/frontend/
RUN corepack enable && pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
# shared 先 build：frontend 类型 import 自 dist（与 CI frontend job 同款前置）
RUN pnpm --filter @remotehub/shared build
RUN pnpm --filter @remotehub/frontend build

FROM nginx:alpine
COPY --from=builder /app/packages/frontend/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
COPY docker/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
